\name{asharechips-package}
\alias{asharechips}
\alias{asharechips-package}
\title{Estimate A-Share Holding-Cost Distributions}
\docType{package}
\description{
Offline preparation and estimation of daily holding-cost distributions for
mainland Chinese A-share equities. Models expose their initialization,
turnover replacement, price allocation and price-basis assumptions.
}
\details{
The preparation function joins locally supplied tables. The estimator returns
weights, statistics and diagnostics. A weighted-mean cost utility is also
provided. Examples and the vignette use synthetic data and require no token.
See the introduction vignette for a worked example and limitations.
}
